<h2><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Appendix A: S=
ample
source code<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<p>The excerpt below, reproduced from Services/SalesService.cs, implements =
the
business rule described in Section 4.6, under which creating a sale
